[00:07.987]I was a kid looking for love, full of hope inside
{"我曾是个追寻爱的孩子　心中满怀希望"}
[00:12.194]But time was never kind to me, my heart grew cold as ice
{"但时光从未善待过我　心如寒冰般冷寂"}
[00:16.525]All out of luck, thought I was stuck alone for all my life
{"运气耗尽　以为此生将永远孤独困守"}
[00:20.443]But I was proven wrong the moment I looked in your eyes
{"直到与你四目相对　才知命运另有安排"}
[00:24.663]
[00:25.021]It's true, until I'm in the grave
{"千真万确　直至长眠入土"}
[00:29.149]Darling, I'll love you for a thousand years, dear
{"亲爱的　我会爱你一千年　亲爱的"}
[00:35.533]Time stops and when I'm here with you
{"时光凝滞　当与你相依偎"}
[00:40.593]All my fears, tears, those memories they disappear with you
{"所有恐惧泪水　那些回忆都随你消散"}
[00:49.141]Till I turn into dust, I'll carry this love, my dear
{"直到化为尘埃　我也会怀揣这份爱　亲爱的"}
[00:56.190]For a thousand years
{"一千年不变"}
[01:05.126]
[01:06.430]The summer is soon, something will bloom like a lotus flower
{"夏日将至　莲花般的美好即将绽放"}
[01:10.866]The bluest moon will soon be sun and turn to golden hour
{"最蓝的月亮将化作骄阳　迎来金色时光"}
[01:15.081]I was in daze, lost in your gaze, losing track of time
{"沉醉恍惚　迷失在你眼眸　忘却时间流逝"}
[01:19.101]Learning how to slow it down, appreciate our lives
{"学会放慢脚步　珍视我们的人生"}
[01:23.148]
[01:23.250]Just know, until I'm in the grave
{"只需知道　直至长眠入土"}
[01:27.699]Darling, I'll love you for a thousand years, dear
{"亲爱的　我会爱你一千年　亲爱的"}
[01:34.007]Time stops and when I'm here with you
{"时光凝滞　当与你相依偎"}
[01:39.331]All my fears, tears, those memories they disappear with you
{"所有恐惧泪水　那些回忆都随你消散"}
[01:47.980]Till I turn into dust, I'll carry this love, my dear
{"直到化为尘埃　我也会怀揣这份爱　亲爱的"}
[01:55.187]For a thousand years
{"一千年不变"}
[01:59.320]
[02:05.155]Set it on fire, let it burn up brighter
{"点燃爱火　让它愈燃愈烈"}
[02:09.731]Love is a flame that's dancing away, that they play on the liar
{"爱是摇曳的火焰　在谎言者耳边舞动"}
[02:13.832]Set it on fire, let the smoke go higher
{"点燃爱火　让烟雾直上云霄"}
[02:17.944]
[02:18.060]Cause darling, I'll love you for a thousand years, dear
{"因为亲爱的　我会爱你一千年　亲爱的"}
[02:24.292]Time stops and when I'm here with you
{"时光凝滞　当与你相依偎"}
[02:29.810]All my fears, dear, those memories they disappear with you
{"我所有恐惧 亲爱的 那些回忆都随你消散"}
[02:38.000]Till the air is all blown, with each breath I'll hold you near
{"直到空气耗尽 每次呼吸都将你紧拥"}
[02:46.041]Till I turn into dust, I'll carry this love, my dear
{"直到化为尘埃 我也会承载这份爱 亲爱的"}
[02:53.924]For a thousand years
{"直到千年以后"}
